sva.tooltip.component.summary=§7Vehicle component · tier §f%s
sva.tooltip.component.for=§7For: §f%s
sva.tooltip.component.details=Made on the "Engineering Workbench" (5x5 grid): a 3x3 recipe goes anywhere in the grid, mirrored too. Components are instant and free of EU - take them from the output, Shift-click makes as many as possible. Not craftable on a crafting table.
sva.tooltip.workbench.summary=§7Input: §f%s§7 (%s EU/t), buffer §f%s EU
sva.tooltip.workbench.details1=5x5 grid: every vehicle component (3x3 recipes anywhere in the grid, instant, no EU) and every vehicle (the whole grid, costs EU and time).
sva.tooltip.workbench.details2=Core upgrades: Overclocker - faster (x0.7 time, x1.12 EU), Energy Storage - +1M EU of buffer, Transformer - +1 input tier (QV-SV vehicles need an HV-IV input), Economizer - x0.8 EU (up to 4).
sva.tooltip.howto.workbench1=Run a Silicon Age or IC2 cable to any side but the front. Right-click: the screen - pick a recipe on the left, "Lay out" moves the parts from your inventory, "Assemble" starts a vehicle.
sva.tooltip.howto.workbench2=Parts are not used up until the assembly ends; change the grid and it is cancelled with nothing lost. A hopper on top puts one item into each empty cell, one below takes the product. A comparator reads the progress.

