sva.tooltip.gas=§7%s: §f%s / %s mB
sva.tooltip.details.hover=An antigravity bike: hovers 1-3 blocks over ground, water and lava; the fastest thing on the ground.
sva.tooltip.vehicle.gas.hover=Hydrogen: %s mB/s to stay up, %s mB/s on boost (x1.35 speed). Helium cools the motor above 40%% heat.
sva.tooltip.limits.hover=Never rises more than 3 blocks over the surface - it does not fly. Without hydrogen or charge it glides down and lands (floats on water and lava), no fall damage. Over lava the rider doesn't catch fire.
sva.tooltip.howto.hover2=W/S - throttle and brake/reverse, A/D - steer, Space - hold higher (up to 3 blocks), sprint (Ctrl) or the Boost key - boost. Shift+right-click - cargo.
sva.tooltip.howto.hover3=Refuel: right-click the bike with a cell or bucket of hydrogen / helium (anyone may) or stop next to a Gas Column. Charge: Vehicle Charging Station.
sva.tooltip.howto.pickUp=Into the inventory: Shift+right-click - cargo - the "Pick up" button (or Shift+right-click with the wrench). Owner only, everyone must get out first; charge, gases and cargo are kept.
sva.gui.pickUp=Pick up
sva.msg.occupied=§eEveryone must get out first
