sva.column.empty=§7  tanks empty - pipe gases in or pour a cell
sva.tooltip.column.summary=§7Tanks: §f%s mB§7 of each gas, refuels §f%s mB/t
sva.tooltip.column.details=Takes Silicon Age gases (H2, He, Ar, O2, D and more) from pipes on any side or from cells and buckets (right-click). A vehicle of the column's owner standing within %s blocks is refuelled by itself - every gas it has a tank for. Needs no power.
sva.tooltip.howto.column=Place it, pipe gas in from tanks or gas machines, and stop next to it. Right-click - the tanks in the chat.
